(16165, 376, 612, 'rafting di sungai progo yang dapat memacu adrenalin. awalnya deg-degan namun asyik juga karena tidak musim hujan dan debet air sungai tidak terlalu deras. pemandangannya masih asli pas banget buat refresh otak. bener-bener memacu adrenalin kita karena perahu yg kita naiki sering nyangkut di batu besar sehingga harus loncat-loncat diatas perahu agar perahu bisa kembali ke arus sungai.', '2023-09-16 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16166, 376, 4856, 'Kami sekeluarga memang suka wisata air....tapi yang satu ini baru pertama kali kami coba. Awalnya deg2an juga apalgi kami cuma berempat ditambah saat itu turun hujan dan debit air sungai lagi tinggi. Tapi setelah perahu jalan plus pemandu yang kompak dan helpfull pd kami....semua berjalan asyik dan seru  rasa lelah hilang setelah rafting dengan suguhan makan siang dan air kelapa muda...malah utk serasa 9 km kurng deh.... next akan kami coba grade selanjutnya. Trima kasih selurh crew Progorafting.', '2022-11-06 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16167, 376, 5432, 'Rafting di Progo atas ini khusus untuk pemula,, awal bulan mei kemarin debit air sungai nya tidak terlalu deras sehingga kurang menantang. Lebih baik kalo rafting pada saat musim hujan sehingga debit nya agak deras. Tarif per boat 750 rb diisi maksimal 6 person', '2021-09-15 00:00:00', ' Teman', 3, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16168, 376, 4602, 'Saat Anda berlibur ke Yogyakarta atau Magelang menginap lah di Hotel Puri Asri - Magelang, di situ Anda dapat mengikuti kegiatan rafting langsung dari sungai di pinggir hotel.Tapi bila Anda tidak menginap di hotel ini, Andapun dapat mengikuti rafting itu di sana juga dengan mendaftar di loket di belakang hotel.Ajaklah keluarga Anda, anak-anakpun bisa asal mereka berani dan dapat berenang. Aliran sungainya sedang ngak sebesar aliran sungai di daerah lain, jadi masih aman buat anak-anak, liburan jadi seru.Pokoknya asyik kegiatan rafting bersama keluarga. Jangan takut ada pemandu langsung yg ikut saat kita rafting. Di akhir rafting karena kelelahan mendayung pihak pengelola menyiapkan untuk kita kelapa muda.Saat mulai naik ke darat dan melewati area persawahan di gubuk di pinggir sawah kita dapat menikmati kelapa muda.', '2021-05-13 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16169, 376, 6928, 'Pengalaman baru yang sangat berkesan ! Dengan tempat dan perjalanan yang menyenangkan juga team yang profesional dan tanggap. Juga dengan fasilitas yang lengkap juga bersih. Benar-benar pilihan yang sangat baik untuk menghabiskan waktu yang sangat berharga dan pasti sangat amat ingin ingin ingin diulangi ;)', '2020-11-13 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16170, 376, 3373, 'Arung jeram, sebagian dari kita yang belum pernah mencoba olahraga air yang satu ini pasti terbayang hal-hal yang menakutkan tentang apa itu rafting.Ya, rafting. Olahraga air yang ternyata bisa jadi wisata air yang mengasyikkan bersama keluarga dan teman-teman. Melatih kerja sama tim dalam mendayung dan merasakan kebersamaan dan kekompakan kelompok. Merasakan sensasi riak aliran sungai Progo yang di beberapa jeram menjadi pengalaman aman yang membuat saya ketagihan mengarungi jeram-jeram di sungai Progo bersama Progo Rafting.Didukung para pemandu yang bersahabat dan menguasai medan, para fotografer yang siap membidik candid peserta arung jeram, serta harga yang cukup terjangkau untuk memulai kegiatan wisata air yang menyenangkan,  yaitu: rafting.Terima kasih progi rafting, pengalaman rafting yang aman dan berkesan membuat saya ketagihan untuk kembali menikmati riak-riak aliran sungai Progo dan jeram-jeram yang akan berubah di saat kemarau dan penghujan. Sensasi tak terlupakan dan terkenang untuk kembali terulang.', '2021-01-13 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16171, 376, 3676, 'Petualangan rafting bersama progo rafting sangat seru dan mengasyikkan :D di tambah dengan pemandunya yang ramah. Apalagi lokasinya berada pada hotel puri asri berbintang 5, jadi kalau capek bisa istirahat disana dan bisa berenang juga karenaa disana juga terdapat kolam renang yang sangat bagus :)', '2023-05-02 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16172, 376, 2708, 'Rafting Kali Progo yang dimulai dari kawasan Hotel Puri Asri Magelang menawarkan petualangan sungai grade III yang aman bagi wisatawan muda maupun senior.  Pemandunya sangat profesional, dan humoris, membaur dengan para penumpangnya.  Namun demikian mereka sangat mengutamakan keselamatan.Di beberapa titik yang arungnya cukup terjal dan berbatu-batu, organizer telah menyiapkan fotografer handal yang dapat merekam reaksi peserta yang sangat beragam.  Rasanya sangat nilmat bisa bertamasya sambil bercanda dan berteriak-teriak dengan bebas di alam terbuka ....Kelapa muda yang dihidangkan pada terminal akhir terasa seperti air surga, sangat manis dan menyegarkan.  Demikian juga nasi bungkusnya.Kami benar2 menikmati rafting Kali Progo, karena selain asyik acaranya cukup aman.  Sedangkan dokumentasinya tinggal dibeli dari organizer dengan harga yang tidak terlalu mahal.', '2020-04-06 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16173, 376, 6898, 'Salah satu tempat rafting yang asik untuk dilakukan, anda bisa menikmati petualangan bersama teman dan keluarga. ada beberapa tingkat kesulitan yang dapat anda ikuti, namun untuk kesulitan yang tinggi anda harus memiliki jam terbang yang tinggi juga. untuk waktu sebaiknya jangan disaat kemarau karena debit air sedikit.', '2020-04-05 00:00:00', NULL, 4, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16174, 376, 3807, 'Senang bisa merasakan rafting di sini. Rafting yang diarasakan oleh para artis hingga pejabat publik. Di sini saya bisa melihat birunya langit dan berenang mengapung. Cocok buat rafting bersama keluarga.', '2021-08-19 00:00:00', NULL, 4, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16175, 376, 1370, 'Wisata serasa itu2 aja, nah kalo nyoba yang ini beda men. Jujur gue suka yang ada deg-deg_annya. Salah satunya ini, walaupun masih terbilang mudah namun lumayan bikin jantung deg2n. Pokoknya sedia 200an per orang udah nutup. Ini belum nyoba yang arus bawah, lagi nabung pingin coba yang itu....', '2023-02-18 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16176, 376, 1208, 'Saya tiba siang hari di hari jumat, karenanya saya harus menunggu saat crew sedang sholat jumat.. saat rafting, jeramnya kurang tinggi karena masih saat surut (disarankan mengambil di bulan januari) tapi overall cukup puas dan makanan yang dihidangkan pun enak.', '2021-03-05 00:00:00', ' Teman', 3, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16177, 400, 2577, 'Went to Kalimun without any bookings and with the intensions to talk to John and get his help for bookings. Unfortunately we learned that John passed away. For travelers wanting help with bookings and accomodations I would recommend to go to the coconut house or just aks around. These islands are amazing', '2025-02-20 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 4, 6, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16178, 400, 1562, 'We had a flat tire while we were scootering around the island Karimunjawa. We were standing next to the road and did not know what to do. Ries helped us with finding a garage. We talked a lot with him and enjoyed the afternoon with him till sunset. He brought us to this restaurant from his mother at the beach. I had the best mango juice and corn fritters. It was an unexpected wonderful day, filled with good energie!', '2023-12-13 00:00:00', ' Sendiri', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16179, 400, 3611, 'my suggestion if want to visit karimunjawa seasky can help you all for transpportation , diving , snorkling , perfect trip .thank you very much.wonderfull', '2023-10-18 00:00:00', ' Sendiri', 5, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16180, 400, 1495, 'We read the great reviews about John and his tours and we contacted him from Italy. When  we arrived we saw him right the way! You cannot miss his orange spot right in front of the harbour! John is such a nice, peaceful person and we did 2 excursions with him just for the 2 of us. We felt like VIP but paying a cheap price! He brought us to several spots for snorkling (beautiful corals and lots of fishes, we also saw the star fishes, amazing!) and to beautiful islands with white sand. He also cooked for us fresh fish and rice. He also gave us good advices and explained us about indonesian culture. Awesome experience! If you go to Karimunjawa don\'t miss John! Alfio and Noemi', '2024-12-05 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 4, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16181, 400, 4327, 'Nice touragency, did the snorkling and the diving with them and it was great! Really Nice staff and good lunch! Boat was not that big but okay for the amount of people that were on there. Would recomend!', '2024-11-20 00:00:00', ' Sendiri', 4, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16182, 400, 1467, 'Be simple, as soon as you arrive, go near the ferry harbor meet John at the SeaSky \"Orange\" Office! He will very help you to organize your stay in Karimunjawa, show you the best beach, and tell you the places where you must be! But the best activity is the snorkeling all day with John!!! He is not expensive at all, he takes little groups (while other tour compagnies fill their boats), and he brings you on the bests spots to see a wonderfull submarin world! It was a very pleasant day!Thank you for all your help and your kindness John. Enjoy Life!!!!A+', '2021-07-21 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16183, 400, 2320, 'I stayed 4days in karimunjawa with my friend, it was our lucky break to meet john, the seasky.At first, i was quite disappointed that the tours were so pricey and nothing much to do.But right after we happened to meet john in the night market, everything changed.It was such a great joy for us to get along with john, sasha from russua and adrian from france.Thanks for giving us a priceless experience. I\'ll miss you all...:)', '2024-05-08 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16184, 400, 64, 'we spent a few days on karimunjawa and felt like we found paradise. snorkeling with jon was definitely the most perfect trip and also the time spent with jon apart from snorkeling was unique. seasky is definitely worth a visit while on karimun :)', '2020-09-10 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16185, 400, 5147, 'I usually dont leave any review but ive gotta do thisWe had snorkeling tour from other agency  first day on the island. it was quite touristic squeeze 20 people on the boat. Nothing but dead coral and small fish we could see. But fortunately we met john in the restaurant and we could join with him.Seasky tour was what we were looking for.Nontouristic calm chilled with the nice people on the island. At snorkeling spot we could see baby sharks and small rays and beautiful corals as well. And we had lunch at john\'s island. Crystal clear water and calm island it was incredible. And we saw beautiful sunset. After sunset we had dinner together and had so nice time with drinking, sharing everyone\'s stories and making jokes around.I could remember every single moment with ma man gangsta john, kind beautiful crazy russian sasha, the nicest guy on the island adrian.I never gonna forget you guys and thanks for making me this precious memory!', '2020-12-19 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16186, 400, 2439, 'Jon was amazing! He looked out for our best interest, and always made sure we were happy. Such a huge help and the greatest guy ', '2020-03-24 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16187, 400, 2417, 'Just arrived we met John. First, he helped us to find a nice guesthouse. Then, he showed us all the think we can do in the island, he had diner with us, he gave us two bikes for free, he tough many coffees with us as well ... we snorkel with him, it\'s was so nice !! Honestly, this guy is really cool and helpful ! Hope see you again John ! Thanks for this amazing week in Karimunjawa !', '2022-12-23 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 2, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16188, 400, 3814, 'Seasky Karimunjawa runned by John is the place to get your information about the island. We had an amazing snorkeling day organized by John. There were only 6 persons on the boat in contrast to other boats that were very crowded. He also helped us finding an accomodation, so we could stay during the weekend without making a reservation. Thanks!', '2020-11-05 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16189, 400, 424, 'I was in Karimunjawa around 1 week and can\'t imagine a best way to enjoy the island if is not with the help of Jon, he is very helpful for everything you need: acommodation, food, chilling out, island hopping, snorkeling, even I could meet french girls who spend a night in a tent in another island and Jon was in charge to arrenge every single detail about that. He is the best, not kidding, just don\'t be shy, approach to his place and ask he has answer for everything and if he doesn\'t, he will look for it. And of course, the best prices also. I just not found help there, I also found a friend, a very good friend, helpful, taking care every moment of the people, and always helping not looking for money, just help people, where can you find people like them nowadays? The world needs more Jons :)', '2022-08-16 00:00:00', ' Sendiri', 5, 2, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16190, 400, 68, 'Seasky run by Jon, he was the only person on the island who replied my emails promptly when most of my enquires to other travel agencies went unanswered.Jon is very helpful with information regarding Karimunjawa. He can arrange most things you need. Snorkeling trips, island hopping or scuba. Recommends good places to eat. Only ask and he will see to it.He is located not to far from the pier. High recommended.', '2020-08-19 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 3, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16191, 400, 4364, 'I spent 5 days in Karimunjawa and since the first one John, gave me many recommendation about the island. He helped us to find a good accommodation, we become immediately friend, I still remember the nights spent with him and some other people just talking and sharing our experience beer and food. He\'s not a business man who wants to cheat or push you, he wants to share with people his love for this beautiful island, we had a nice trip boat around the island an unforgettable day of fun faraway from the tourist place where usually the tourist trip goes. If you are in Karimunjawa you have to meet John because he\'s the soul of the island.', '2025-01-25 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16192, 400, 1537, 'We went to Karimun in the springtime, knowing nothing about the islands other than they had good snorkeling. John made our trip there so amazing that we stayed there an extra day. He recommended beaches, restaurants, invited us for coffee or cards in the evenings, designed a custom snorkeling/beach trip for us, and overall just made us feel at home. I couldn\'t recommend him or his services enough.', '2022-05-26 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16193, 400, 6709, 'Done a hopping island with John from Seasky, just to say usually I don\'t like the organized tours in asia but this one was different... you do a tour around places with no tourist, not crowded at all and also with a small group (we were 8), when other tours in the island putt you in a bout with 25 people... The tour was amazing, John was sublime, taking photos of us and taking care of the last detail. Amazing sunset in an island with no tourist, and we finished the night with a Seafood BBQ at hos place. Also he can help you with cheap accomodation and everything you need. John \"the man of the island\" 100% recommended! Thanks for this amazing day! 😀', '2024-11-19 00:00:00', ' Sendiri', 5, 3, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16194, 400, 1049, 'John is the Man , best tours on the island , small groups and of the beaten track , friendly and great service with a heart of gold . Absolutey recommended.', '2022-08-18 00:00:00', ' Sendiri', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16195, 400, 1292, 'I remember meeting Jon a couple of years ago and he was super friendly and gave us the best offer, cheapest I must say. This year, I\'m using Seasky again because I had a great time with Jon and his friends last time. We\'re becoming friends now and I\'m planning to go solo travel to Karimunjawa again next year with Seasky! Thank you, Jon!', '2024-09-11 00:00:00', NULL, 5, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16196, 400, 5213, 'John can sort out some good accomodating at cheap prices...80k , 100k and more depending on fan or aircon etc etc. He has a good knowledge of the islands and is straight talking..ie you ask him a question and he wiĺl do his best to answer it honestly', '2022-09-12 00:00:00', ' Sendiri', 5, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16197, 400, 2417, 'Just arrived we met John. First, he helped us to find a nice guesthouse. Then, he showed us all the think we can do in the island, he had diner with us, he gave us two bikes for free, he tough many coffees with us as well ... we snorkel with him, it\'s was so nice !! Honestly, this guy is really cool and helpful ! Hope see you again John ! Thanks for this amazing week in Karimunjawa !', '2024-07-24 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16198, 400, 3814, 'Seasky Karimunjawa runned by John is the place to get your information about the island. We had an amazing snorkeling day organized by John. There were only 6 persons on the boat in contrast to other boats that were very crowded. He also helped us finding an accomodation, so we could stay during the weekend without making a reservation. Thanks!', '2024-02-27 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
