(16200, 400, 68, 'Seasky run by Jon, he was the only person on the island who replied my emails promptly when most of my enquires to other travel agencies went unanswered.Jon is very helpful with information regarding Karimunjawa. He can arrange most things you need. Snorkeling trips, island hopping or scuba. Recommends good places to eat. Only ask and he will see to it.He is located not to far from the pier. High recommended.', '2024-05-09 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
