(16204, 400, 1049, 'John is the Man , best tours on the island , small groups and of the beaten track , friendly and great service with a heart of gold . Absolutey recommended.', '2020-10-28 00:00:00', ' Sendiri', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16205, 400, 1292, 'I remember meeting Jon a couple of years ago and he was super friendly and gave us the best offer, cheapest I must say. This year, I\'m using Seasky again because I had a great time with Jon and his friends last time. We\'re becoming friends now and I\'m planning to go solo travel to Karimunjawa again next year with Seasky! Thank you, Jon!', '2020-07-19 00:00:00', NULL, 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16206, 400, 5213, 'John can sort out some good accomodating at cheap prices...80k , 100k and more depending on fan or aircon etc etc. He has a good knowledge of the islands and is straight talking..ie you ask him a question and he wiĺl do his best to answer it honestly', '2025-01-06 00:00:00', ' Sendiri', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16207, 400, 3239, 'John, great guy! Most easy going bloke on the island. Ask him anything he\'all know the answer.Showed us a brilliant time. Highly recommend', '2021-10-28 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16208, 400, 4264, 'Jon (no \"h\") is the man for you if you want to see the best of the Islands. There\'s no better recommendation like those from past clients. We met such a couple and have no reservations writing this to help you with your trip(s). Jon provided bikes, (delivered to and picked up from our resort), gave us a great trip diving, snorkelling and then to a beautiful island for dinner, and recommended a super place to eat on the island. His english is excellent and he could be Kariman\'s answer to Bristol\'s \"Banksy\". No he doesn\'t draw on buildings - just on his \'phone - check them out when you meet him.Good luck Jon - really nice to meet you. Keep on smilingTrevor, Diana and Chris (May 2016)', '2024-05-31 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29');
INSERT INTO `review` (`id`, `destinasi_id`, `reviewer_id`, `review_text`, `tanggal`, `status`, `rating`, `jempol`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(16209, 400, 1129, 'Mas / Mr. John is so generous and very helpful! We had great experiences there because of him! He showed us to many beautiful places in Karimun Jawa. He also helped us arranging transport from Karimun Jawa to Jepara and made sure that we arrived in Jepara safe and sound. Once again.. We\'re very glad to meet Mas John! If you\'re coming to Karimun Jawa don\'t hesitate to contact him. He\'s so reccomended! ', '2020-09-05 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16210, 400, 2309, 'We met John at our hotel, I send him an email after reading positive feedback on TA. He immediatly awnsered and showed up within 10 minutes.From the moment we first met him he was really friendly and not pushy. He just tells you the possibilities and ask what you would like to do.   We had not received this friendly voice anywhere in Karimunjawa or in our hotel so we were very pleased. We ended up meeting each other 3 days/ night and he proved to me to be more then an normal ( business orientated) guide.John is always in for an adventure, a drink partner in the evening, helping you with whatever question you have or change out stories and jokes while hanging out on the beach. He even taught me how to ride scooter and went on a trip with me / showing nice scenery. He is genuinely interested in you.Also he is clever and can tell you all about the indonesian culture in a really interesting way.Its hard to describe with words why we enjoyed him so much, but for us he made karimunjawa a really GOOD experience.What I would maybe not have if I didnt get the guidance from John.To put my phrase together: John is top notch guide and good person, one of the best.Goodbye John ', '2021-12-23 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16211, 400, 4178, 'The snorkeling tour i did with my father and john was amasing! He can design with you a special tour if you want to see particular islands and he knows awesome spots for snorkelling and diving.John is also always available to give you tips for tourism in  karimunjawa. Just go and talk to him if you go to karimunjawa, you wont loose your time. Thanks john for that experience and your accessibility! I hope to see you again in karimunjawa. ', '2023-04-12 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16212, 400, 3450, 'When we arrived on Karimunjawa we didn\'t know where to sleep, what to see and eat. Then we have met John. Thank you for everything! Nara! ', '2022-07-07 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16213, 400, 2288, 'Do you need anything in Karimunjawa? Diving? Snorkeling? Island hopping? Accommodation? Motorbike? Just go to Seasky! This man as the control in the island, the real boss. Tips and advises. Even better. He is so funny. You will see :)', '2022-10-16 00:00:00', ' Sendiri', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16214, 400, 2271, 'We had been travelling through Indonesia for over 2 months so when John approached us and we thought here we go another salesman trying to rip us off! However how wrong we were. John chatted with us and gave us advise about the island and told us about the boat trips including his prices but told us to check out others as well to compare. What sold us though was his realism and love for the environment and nature. We booked a best tour with him and it was amazing. Go to his island.. Beautiful! The day after our host trip we saw John again at dinner and he gave the girls a present. We then got chatting and went back to the HQ where we had beers with Mr Moor who owns the office building/house and also was ohr host driver, with Jamal (hahahaha) who was our guide on the boat trip and John himself (Mr rock and roll.. Take I easy)! Many other locals popped in as well and we had an amazing night getting to know them all and telling  stories. One of my best experiences of Indonesia! Cheers John for all your help! ', '2020-01-05 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16215, 400, 1951, 'John is absolutely great guy! He is so nice, kind and helpful! I\'m definitely recommending this tourist office if you are going to Karimunjawa :) Greetings from Finland!', '2023-03-01 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16216, 400, 4040, 'Mr. John, the owner of seasky became my friends during their stay on the island. Greatly helped me all kinds of information about the inhabitants and the attractions of the island. For him I have only words of praise.', '2024-01-21 00:00:00', NULL, 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16217, 409, 6220, 'Bagus, tempat nya bersih terawat dan lebih amamzing dari sebelum nya.Untuk pengelola nya sudah berpengalman, serta bisa lebih dekat, lebih indah, lebih modern.', '2023-09-17 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16218, 409, 3354, 'emmmmm so amazing visit di Solo Safari 🌸 apalagi bareng temen, berkesan dgn pelayanan, view, fasilitas dan of course with the animal so cute🥰 wishlist di bulan kemerdekaan ini bisa visit lagi ke sini bareng couple 😍 imagine with the fun of travelling cixixi', '2023-09-20 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16219, 409, 4353, 'Sangat berkesan dan sangat Happy banget bisa ajak anak mengenal lebih dekat satwa dan bisa menikmati menu yg sangat mantap jiwa di bengawan resto 🤤 rasanya ingin mengulang kesini lagi', '2020-02-10 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16220, 146, 1354, 'Trip yg memuaskan, it\'s worthed for your pocket. Pelayanannya istimewa, terutama karena kami membawa anak2. ', '2021-11-22 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16221, 146, 4010, 'Lumayan ok, tur nya menyenangkan, makanannya cocok+enak meskipun tidak mewah, tur guide ramah dan asik', '2021-12-07 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 4, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16222, 146, 6761, 'Karimunjawa adalah salah satu pulau diluar pulau Jawa...Pulau Menjangan adalah salah satu pulau dari sekian banyak pulau di kepulauan Karimunjawa.Dan di pulau Menjangan ini ada resort...', '2024-10-06 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16223, 146, 1296, 'Pelayanan dan komunikasi excellent, cuma belum sempat berkunjung ke spot foto yg di gunung, semoga kesempatan berikutnya bisa berkunjung ke semua tempat wisata di karimunjawa', '2023-04-29 00:00:00', ' Bisnis', 4, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16224, 146, 6523, 'bareng dolphin karimunjawa, pelayanan the best lahuntuk personal, keluarga atau pun instansi sangat recomended', '2024-10-06 00:00:00', ' Bisnis', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16225, 146, 6543, 'Pelayanan yang bagus dan sangat recommended bagi semua wisatawan baik local maupun macanegare. Harga yang reasonable membuat saya yakin akan berlangganan dengan paket tour karimun jawa Dolphin.', '2024-09-14 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16226, 146, 6696, 'Fasilitator (EO) sangat bagus. Request apapun di penuhi. Service sangat bagus. Komunikatif bgt. Puasss sama pelayanannya', '2023-01-25 00:00:00', ' Bisnis', 4, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16227, 146, 5231, 'Trip dengan 53 orang, acara kantor, luar biasa dan service excellent sekali tim dolphinThankyou yaaaa mas ois dan tim! permintaan aneh-aneh dari panitia bisa diwujudkan', '2022-09-29 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16228, 146, 437, 'Honeymoon di karimunjawa sangat berkesan dan luar bisa.. menyenangkan sekali bisa berkunjung di pulau karimunjawa.. pengalaman yg tdk bisa terlupakan..Terima kasih dolphin karimunjawa.. 🏝👍', '2021-02-13 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16229, 146, 6218, 'Puas sekali berkunjung ke Karimun Jawa dengan Dolphin Karimunjawa. Diajak jalan - jalan ke pantai yang indah - indah, terus diajak juga ke tempat snorkeling yang kereeeeen. Terus serunya, waktu snorkling, kalau mau foto di dasar laut kedalaman 5 meter, masnya sanggup ikutin kemauan kita. Hasil fotonya juga keren banget!!', '2021-05-07 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16230, 146, 1354, 'Trip yg memuaskan, it\'s worthed for your pocket. Pelayanannya istimewa, terutama karena kami membawa anak2. ', '2022-11-11 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16231, 146, 4010, 'Lumayan ok, tur nya menyenangkan, makanannya cocok+enak meskipun tidak mewah, tur guide ramah dan asik', '2021-12-08 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 4, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16232, 146, 6761, 'Karimunjawa adalah salah satu pulau diluar pulau Jawa...Pulau Menjangan adalah salah satu pulau dari sekian banyak pulau di kepulauan Karimunjawa.Dan di pulau Menjangan ini ada resort...', '2024-10-06 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16233, 146, 1296, 'Pelayanan dan komunikasi excellent, cuma belum sempat berkunjung ke spot foto yg di gunung, semoga kesempatan berikutnya bisa berkunjung ke semua tempat wisata di karimunjawa', '2020-11-18 00:00:00', ' Bisnis', 4, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16234, 146, 6523, 'bareng dolphin karimunjawa, pelayanan the best lahuntuk personal, keluarga atau pun instansi sangat recomended', '2024-07-22 00:00:00', ' Bisnis', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16235, 146, 6543, 'Pelayanan yang bagus dan sangat recommended bagi semua wisatawan baik local maupun macanegare. Harga yang reasonable membuat saya yakin akan berlangganan dengan paket tour karimun jawa Dolphin.', '2024-11-11 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16236, 146, 6696, 'Fasilitator (EO) sangat bagus. Request apapun di penuhi. Service sangat bagus. Komunikatif bgt. Puasss sama pelayanannya', '2023-07-03 00:00:00', ' Bisnis', 4, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16237, 146, 5231, 'Trip dengan 53 orang, acara kantor, luar biasa dan service excellent sekali tim dolphinThankyou yaaaa mas ois dan tim! permintaan aneh-aneh dari panitia bisa diwujudkan', '2022-09-10 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16238, 146, 437, 'Honeymoon di karimunjawa sangat berkesan dan luar bisa.. menyenangkan sekali bisa berkunjung di pulau karimunjawa.. pengalaman yg tdk bisa terlupakan..Terima kasih dolphin karimunjawa.. 🏝👍', '2023-05-20 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16239, 146, 6218, 'Puas sekali berkunjung ke Karimun Jawa dengan Dolphin Karimunjawa. Diajak jalan - jalan ke pantai yang indah - indah, terus diajak juga ke tempat snorkeling yang kereeeeen. Terus serunya, waktu snorkling, kalau mau foto di dasar laut kedalaman 5 meter, masnya sanggup ikutin kemauan kita. Hasil fotonya juga keren banget!!', '2021-01-08 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16240, 401, 2567, 'The place are so good and spacious. They sell many products, such as silver jewelry, t-shirt, batik, handicraft. And there\'s also restaurant nearby, BS Resto.', '2021-11-18 00:00:00', NULL, 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16241, 401, 2645, 'This gift shop is truly remarkable. It has all kind of different Indonesian handicrafts, such as batik, silver jewellery, handcrafted t-shirts etc. At the gift shop you can also do workshops, such as creating your own silver jewellery, pottery and playing the traditional Indonesian music instrument (gamelan). At the place where the gift shop is located there is also a restaurant called BS resto, the food is really good and you are surrounded by nature.', '2024-05-29 00:00:00', NULL, 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16242, 274, 5476, 'Rafting memang asyik untuk adrenalin junkies, tapi kalau sudah punya anak, apalagi balita, rafting jadi gak aman. Alternatifnya ya , water tubing. Segar bisa main air dan ada sensasi hanyutnya. Muncul water tubing sangat cocok. Mengalir dari mata air muncul yg legendaris, menuju ke rawa pening, di sepanjang jalur sungai yg segar airnya, kita bisa melihat gunung2 yag mengapit daerah muncul. Wow luar biasa.', '2023-05-20 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16243, 274, 4561, 'The real adventureDitempat yang sejuk di daerah pedesaan yang masih asri dan alami, dengan sungai yang jernih dan menyegarkan.', '2023-12-09 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16244, 405, 6721, 'Bagaimana tidak spot jantungan kalo banyak track yang menantang, untung pendamping profesional semuanya. jadi kita aman.', '2024-04-09 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16245, 405, 2098, 'Bukan pengalaman baru, tapi selalu mendapat kejutan tia rafting di sungai serayu bareng @thepikasadventure. Instrukturnya ramah, pengertian, dan juga perhatian. Tapi ngga bikin baper, lho. Karwna memang tugas mereka mendampingi para tetamu. Hahaha. Sajian after rafting juga nyelakamin, ada kelapa muda sama mendoan. Uuwh...kapan-kapan rafting lagi!', '2024-08-28 00:00:00', ' Teman', 4, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16246, 405, 4644, 'Sungai Serayu ini adalah sungai untuk Rafting, lebar dan banyak batu. Di tepi sungai banyak yang agent yang membuka paketan untuk Rafting di sungai ini', '2023-06-30 00:00:00', ' Bisnis', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16247, 405, 1405, 'Untuk rafting d sungai ini cukup unik.bda dengan yg d Progo.untuk jarak nya 14km.arus nya TDK terlalu extreem.soale pas musim panas.safety guard nya selalu d depan.menjaga apabila ada hal2 yg TDK d inginkan terjadi', '2024-06-13 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 4, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16248, 405, 4038, 'Saya dan teman-teman saya sudah merancanakn agenda ini jauh jauh hari, namun baru kesampean di awal bulan DES 2016. Sebenarnya sungai serayu ini debit airnya akan lebih deras di musim hujan ( sep-feb ), so buat kamu yg pemula saya sarankan jangan di bulan-bulan itu, karena sedikit berbahaya, but if you are looking sensation in advanture, it will be a good time. Ada dua operator untuk radting di sungai serayu, kebetulan tempatnya hanya 1km dri rumah saya. Kalau yg disebelah selatan namanya Serayu advanture dan yg disebelah utara namaya The Pikas. Dua-duanya operator rafting yg good record. Their accommodation are complet in my point of view. Rute arum jeram juga variasi.. so.. Let\'s go and check it out. 💌Note : The best time to Rafting is around (March to Sep ) the debit water are clean are save.Lokasinya bisa cek di map atau buat yg bingung nih saya kasih...Desa Singamerta, Jl. Raya Singamerta-Madukara Rt.01 Rw.01 Kecamatan Sigaluh Kab.Banjarnegara.😘Foto diambil di depan sepeda antik yg dijadikan pajangan The Pikas', '2024-11-05 00:00:00', ' Teman', 4, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16249, 405, 689, 'Asyik banget disini, àpalagi kemarin arus agak deres jadi rasa gelombangnya muanteeeeppp. Gak nyesel, plus safety lho', '2022-08-07 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16250, 405, 5692, 'Hal yang sangat berkesan di waktu kecil saya, adalah bermain air di sungai. Namun  kondisi waktu itu tentu hanya sekedar mandi dan menelusuri sungai Serayu dengan berjalan kaki di pinggir sungai. Arung jeram menimbulkan sensasi luar biasa, karena menelusuri sungai dengan perahu kecil di tengah air sungai yang penuh batu dengan pemandangan indah di kiri kanan. Hal ini ditambah sajian wisata yang di berikan pengelola berupa makan mendoan di perjalanan dipinggir kali, dengan minuman kelapa muda, kemudian dilanjutkan makan siang di ngarai serayu terasa romantis berdua dengan istri. Iringan lagu \"Kesempurnaan Cinta\" Rizki Febian membuat  Romantisme jadi terasa lengkap. PATUT DICOBA TOP.', '2023-02-11 00:00:00', ' Pasangan', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16251, 405, 2959, 'Saya pernah sekali arung jeram di sungai serayu kebetulan lagi musim hujan jadi aliran sungainya deras dan seru buat arung jeram , fasilitasnya juga bagus . Menantang adrenalin bagi yang suka susana alam . ', '2024-09-02 00:00:00', ' Teman', 4, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16252, 405, 1323, 'Seru banget main arung jeram disini,dengan grade 3+ dan jeram yang bervariatif membuat seru dan asik banget....pemandangan sekitar sungai juga indah dan keren...dari pusat kota banjarnegara sekitar 5km berada di zona the lukas resort banjarnegara', '2023-10-08 00:00:00', ' Keluarga', 5, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16253, 405, 6348, 'Serayu River melalui the pixas/Banyu Wong salahsatu operator arung jeram di Banjarnegara.Tempatnya luas dilengkapi tempat istirahat,aula,mushola,toilet yg banyak dan tempat parkir yang luas.Arung jeramnya akan dipandu oleh tim ahli yang mengarahkan kapan harus mendayung dan cari jalannya.Ditengah jalur arung jeram akan beristirahat menikmati kelapa muda dan mendoan.Rasakan sensasinya dalam berarung jeram.', '2023-11-28 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 1, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
(16254, 405, 6721, 'Bagaimana tidak spot jantungan kalo banyak track yang menantang, untung pendamping profesional semuanya. jadi kita aman.', '2020-03-20 00:00:00', ' Teman', 5, 0, '2025-10-21 22:21:29', '2025-10-21 22:21:29'),
